meta {
  name: 2h. OCI Cluster Create (OCI 클러스터 생성)
  type: http
  seq: 17
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/vms
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  content-type: application/json
  Idempotency-Key: {{$randomUUID}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "vmGroupName": "{{provision_cluster_name}}",
    "provider": "OCI",
    "description": "Oracle Cloud Infrastructure 기반 Kubernetes 클러스터",
    "environment": "{{provision_environment}}",
    "region": "{{provision_region}}",
    "credentialId": "{{credential_id}}",
    "config": {
      "anycloud-k8s:ociCompartmentId": "{{oci_compartment_id}}",
      "anycloud-k8s:masterInstanceType": "{{master_vm_spec}}",
      "anycloud-k8s:workerInstanceType": "{{worker_vm_spec}}",
      "anycloud-k8s:workerCount": "{{worker_count}}",
      "anycloud-k8s:kubernetesVersion": "{{kubernetes_version}}",
      "anycloud-k8s:vpcCidr": "{{vpc_cidr}}",
      "anycloud-k8s:podCidr": "{{pod_cidr}}",
      "anycloud-k8s:serviceCidr": "{{service_cidr}}",
      "anycloud-k8s:enableIngress": "{{enable_ingress}}",
      "anycloud-k8s:enableGpuOperator": "{{enable_gpu_operator}}"
    }
  }
}

script:post-response {
  if (res.body && res.body.data && res.body.data.id) {
    bru.setEnvVar('last_operation_id', res.body.data.id);
  }
}

tests {
  test("상태 코드 202", function() {
    expect(res.getStatus()).to.equal(202);
  });
}

docs {
  ## Oracle Cloud Infrastructure 기반 cluster 생성

  ### Required env vars (local-oci-provisioning.bru)
  - `provision_provider: OCI`
  - `provision_region`: e.g. `us-ashburn-1`, `ap-seoul-1`
  - `credential_id`: OCI credential UUID
  - **`oci_compartment_id`** (필수): VCN/compute 가 만들어질 compartment OCID
    (`ocid1.compartment.oc1..xxxx`)
  - `master_vm_spec` / `worker_vm_spec`: e.g. `VM.Standard.E4.Flex_2`, `VM.Standard.A1.Flex_4`
    (ARM Ampere 가 가성비)

  ### OCI 만의 config
  - `anycloud-k8s:ociCompartmentId` (필수)
  - 옵션: `anycloud-k8s:osImage` — `ocid1.image....` 형식 (지정 안 하면 Canonical Ubuntu 24.04)

  ### OCI 의 특수 사항
  - Spot/preemptible 미지원 — 일반 shape 만
  - Dynamic Group + Policy 자동 생성 (cloud-controller-manager 권한)

  ### 실행
  ```bash
  bru run "VM Cluster (VM 클러스터)/2h. OCI Cluster Create (OCI 클러스터 생성).bru" \
      --env local-oci-provisioning
  ```
}
